{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23376","headline":"和微之诗二十三首 和栉沐寄道友 · 白居易","name":"和微之诗二十三首 和栉沐寄道友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"栉沐事朝谒，中门初动关。\n盛服去尚早，假寐须臾间。\n钟声发东寺，夜色藏南山。\n停骖待五漏，人马同时闲。\n高星粲金粟，落月沈玉环。\n出门向关路，坦坦无阻艰。\n始出里北閈，稍转市西闤。\n晨烛照朝服，紫烂复朱殷。\n由来朝廷士，一入多不还。\n因循掷白日，积渐凋朱颜。\n青云已难致，碧落安能攀。\n但且知止足，尚可销忧患。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23376.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23376","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}